{"updated":"2026-11-14T15:31:43.786Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Dft-ss9EwuY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dft-ss9EwuY","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini最近出了多款新模型\n一分鐘帶你了解\n#AI","timestamp":"2026-11-14T10:22:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DftIxBkgKxL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DftIxBkgKxL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"用Fable做的影片","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:30:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq_yD8k8SC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_yD8k8SC","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把新北歡樂耶誕城搬進瀏覽器了，還能揪朋友一起逛。🎄\n輸入暱稱、分享房間連結，大家就會出現在同一座 3D 耶誕城。\n每間房間最多 40 人，也能用私人房間代碼約朋友集合。\n一起逛市民廣場、板橋車站、萬坪公園等燈區 \n邊走邊聊天，揮手、比愛心、跳舞、擺 Pose\n按下拍照，全房間收到 3 秒倒數提示\n合照能套耶誕框或拍立得，下載留念\n走到捷運站搭車，前往淡水、新莊等響應燈區","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq_x9pkye5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_x9pkye5","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"線上一起逛\nntpc-christmasland-3d.malilion.workers.d…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq79LyE1LH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79LyE1LH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"13 張 AI 圖，約 1.3 美元的生圖成本。 \n作者把它們做成了一套 3D 萬聖節村莊素材。\n 📦 更有趣的是，每個模型還能從一張平面紙，慢慢「折」成立體。\n這個開源 Claude Code Skill 叫 Origami-3Dfolder-ai，走的是一套數位摺紙流程： 幾何形狀 → UV 展開圖 → AI 上色 → Blender 折回 3D\n－製作木箱、桌子、攤位、樹木等低多邊形道具 －輸出帶貼圖的 GLB，接進 Three.js \n－附上 Fold 動畫，讓素材自己折出來\n－已有符合格式的紙模型圖樣，也能跳過 AI 上色 作者示範用 12 種資產，在場景裡擺放 75 次，再讓物件沿著道路依序折起來，組成一座萬聖節村莊。 \n目前以簡單形狀為主，需要 Blender 4.x；AI 上色需付費 API。 1.3 美元是作者的示範成本，場景編排工具則不包含在 repo。","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq79C-k4JH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79C-k4JH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/lejri…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfuXypeAWw3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuXypeAWw3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原來司機會有這種困擾？！😲\n一位卡友發現最近看到有人在討論\n下公車要不要跟司機說謝謝\n因為有網友在公車上看到一個公告\n寫著「下車時請不用說謝謝」\n不用兩字還特別加粗\n\n有司機就出來說\n是因為怕沒說不客氣被客訴\n而且每個人都說謝謝的話要一直回很累\n\n大家會習慣說謝謝嗎？🧐","timestamp":"2026-11-14T14:00:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":6,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ13biQsP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ13biQsP","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"快來分享你們的娃包😍\n一位卡友發現 現在出門人手一個娃包\n我也來分享我的烏薩奇寶寶～\n\n想看看大家的娃包😆呀哈！","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":9,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":23,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ3PMCZ-z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ3PMCZ-z","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B2卡友：最近剛幫吉伊寶寶買了新的包包🥰","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-15T00:28:05+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ4h_icH3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ4h_icH3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","conten